1. **Redemption Price from 8-K (July 28, 2020):** The CCOH Issuers issued a conditional notice of redemption on July 21, 2020, to redeem all of the 5.875% Senior Notes due 2024 on August 20, 2020. The redemption price was **$1,029.38 per $1,000 principal amount**, plus accrued and unpaid interest.

