- The increase from $338 (FY 2018) to $345 (FY 2019) reflects higher average daily hotel room rates and guest spending. The increase to $356 in FY 2020 occurred despite COVID-19 impacts, as occupancy dropped dramatically (from 88% to 41%) but per-room spending on remaining guests was higher.

