- The 10-K does not disclose any specific one-time "adjustment," true-up, catch-up, or modification to stock-based compensation expense itself for fiscal year 2022.

**Answer: $413 million** — this is the amount Applied Materials adjusted (added back) for stock-based compensation in its cash flow statement for fiscal year 2022.

