The year-over-year percentage growth in Total Assets for the Life segment of Globe Life Inc. (NYSE:GL) from December 31, 2020, to December 31, 2021, was **5.92%**.

**Calculation:**
- Total Assets for Life segment as of December 31, 2020: $4,291,767,000 (from 2020 10-K, Note 14—Business Segments)
- Total Assets for Life segment as of December 31, 2021: $4,546,010,000 (from 2021 10-K, Note 14—Business Segments)

Year-over-year growth = ((4,546,010 - 4,291,767) / 4,291,767) × 100
= (254,243 / 4,291,767) × 100
= 0.059239287 × 100
= 5.9239287%
= **5.92%** (rounded to two decimal places)

