Based on my extensive review of Arch Capital Group's (ACGL) SEC filings, including 10-K filings from 2018 through 2024 and quarterly reports, **Arch Capital Group did not have any convertible notes outstanding at the end of 2022.** 

I searched through the following filings for any mention of convertible notes, convertible debt, or convertible securities:

- 2022 10-K (filed Feb 24, 2023, for period ending Dec 31, 2022)
- 2021 10-K (filed Feb 25, 2022)
