## Calculation of Percentage Increase in Stock Price for Severance Valuation

### Stock Prices Identified:
- **September 30, 2022**: $85.27 per share (closing sale price on Nasdaq Global Select Market)
- **September 27, 2024**: $98.85 per share (closing sale price on Nasdaq Global Select Market)

### Percentage Increase Calculation:

The formula for percentage increase is:
$$\text{Percentage Increase} = \frac{\text{New Value} - \text{Old Value}}{\text{Old Value}} \times 100$$

Substituting the values:
$$\text{Percentage Increase} = \frac{98.85 - 85.27}{85.27} \times 100$$

$$\text{Percentage Increase} = \frac{13.58}{85.27} \times 100$$

$$\text{Percentage Increase} = 0.159258825026... \times 100$$

$$\text{Percentage Increase} = 15.9258825026...\%$$

### Final Answer (rounded to two decimal places):
**15.93%**

